# The findings of tests/pack-links.test.sh's bug checks that the shipped packs
# already have, one per line: pack, kind, the skill's path, the name.
# A finding not listed here fails the run. A listed one that no longer happens
# fails it too: delete its line when the skill is fixed. The list is sorted as
# `LC_ALL=C sort` sorts it and holds no line twice. A change that brings a pack
# up to the standard empties that pack's lines; the last one deletes this file
# and makes PACK_LINKS_STRICT=1 the default. PACK_LINKS_VERBOSE=1 prints each
# finding with its reason.
encrypted-containers unlisted skills/archives/protected.md 7z
network-forensics unused skills/beacons/periodicity.md pcap_summary
network-forensics unused skills/capture/carve-from-images.md bulk_extractor
network-forensics unused skills/correlate/host.md beacon_score
network-forensics unused skills/correlate/host.md timestamp_decode
network-forensics unused skills/logs/web-proxy-firewall.md timestamp_decode
network-forensics unused skills/metadata/dns-tls.md pcap_summary
network-forensics unused skills/metadata/dns-tls.md zeek
network-forensics unused skills/metadata/dns-tls.md zeek_run
network-forensics unused skills/sessions/reconstruct.md pcap_summary
network-forensics unused skills/sessions/reconstruct.md zeek_run
triage-collection unlisted skills/gaps/what-is-missing.md fsstat
triage-collection unlisted skills/identify/collector.md CyLR
triage-collection unused skills/identify/collector.md file_type
triage-collection unused skills/plan/what-to-collect.md uac
triage-collection unused skills/plan/what-to-collect.md velociraptor
